{"title":"Thorn Cutting","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Monster drop: Briar Warden, Briarling, The Briar Heart, Elder Briar Warden</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"briar-warden\" title=\"Briar Warden - dropped it in 41 of 127 looted corpses (1/3)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/063ade370878ba4c7c5b.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Briar Warden</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/3<br>×1–3</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"elder-briar-warden\" title=\"The Briar Heart - dropped it in 10 of 44 looted corpses (1/4)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/dc99e407833d39dfdb68.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">The Briar Heart</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/4<br>×1–5</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"briarling\" title=\"Briarling - dropped it in 9 of 42 looted corpses (1/5)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/459d2dd350c89abe5e38.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Briarling</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/5<br>×1–2</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses of each monster whose loot was recorded), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"thorn-cutting\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/armor-smithing\">Armor smithing</a></p>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Used to make</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li><a href=\"#/item/thorn-feet\">Thorn Feet</a> <span cla